flowchart LR
    App["app: socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM, IPPROTO_MPTCP)"]
    Connect["connect(): MPTCP-aware<br/>SYN with MP_CAPABLE option"]
    Established["primary subflow"]

    Sub1["primary subflow<br/>(eth0, IP1 ↔ peer IP1)"]
    Sub2["secondary subflow added<br/>via MP_JOIN<br/>(eth1, IP2 ↔ peer IP2)"]
    Sub3["...optionally more subflows..."]

    Sched["mptcp scheduler decides<br/>which subflow gets each segment"]

    Connect --> Established --> Sub1
    Sub1 --> Sub2 --> Sub3
    Sub1 --> Sched
    Sub2 --> Sched
    Sub3 --> Sched

